  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Diakonia 2010-2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diakonia HR/Dem 2010-2013 - Civila samh&#xe4;llsst&#xf6;d</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diakonia both strengthens the capacity of local NGOs as well as their activities within the areas of human rights and democracy. The goal   of the programme is to deepend democratic participation among         grassroots to facilitate a strong local development, leading to a     reduction of poverty, increased self-determination and better         material and emotional standards of living.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Diakonia st&#xe4;rker lokala NGOs kapacitet samt st&#xf6;djer verksamhet inom   MR och demokrati. M&#xe5;let med programmet &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rdjupa det            demokratiska deltagandet p&#xe5; gr&#xe4;srotsniv&#xe5; f&#xf6;r att bidraga till en      st&#xe4;rkt utveckling p&#xe5; lokal niv&#xe5; somleder till minskad fattigdom och   b&#xe4;ttre materiell och k&#xe4;nslom&#xe4;ssig levnadsstandard.</narrative>
  </description>
